rmsText\"><![CDATA[Quick approval | Flexible tenure options | Zero approval fees]]></prop></checkeligibility><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[Overview of Duroflex and Kurlon mattresses]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Duroflex and Kurlon are two of the most renowned mattress brands in India, offering a variety of options tailored to different sleep needs. <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/duroflex?utm_source=bfl_website&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=duroflex-mattress-vs-kurlon\">Duroflex mattresses</a> are known for their orthopaedic support, durability, and advanced pressure relief technology, making them ideal for back support. In contrast, Kurlon mattresses focus on plush comfort, coir-based support, and affordability, catering to those who prefer a softer sleeping surface. Whether you need firm spinal support or a luxurious cushioning feel, both brands offer a wide range of choices. Explore a selection of <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/kurlon?utm_source=bfl_website&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=duroflex-mattress-vs-kurlon\">Kurlon mattresses</a> to find the perfect fit for your sleep comfort.&nbsp;</p><br><p>Explore mattresses at any of Bajaj Finance’s %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner stores in %$$EMI-locheft$$% cities in India. Choose your ideal model, pay with Easy EMIs, and enjoy zero down payment on select deals. Simply&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/easy-emi-consumer-durables-loan?sso-module=adp&amp;dynamic-redirection=false\">check your loan eligibility</a> now and bring home your desired product without worrying about overspending.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[Duroflex vs Kurlon - Which is better for your needs]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Choosing between Duroflex and Kurlon depends on your comfort preferences, budget, sleeping habits and the specific features you value in a mattress.</p><br><table><tbody><tr><td>Feature</td><td>Duroflex</td><td>Kurlon</td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>Firm orthopaedic support</td><td>Plush comfort, coir-based support</td></tr><tr><td>Key benefits</td><td>Pressure relief, durability</td><td>Affordability</td></tr><tr><td>Spinal alignment</td><td>Designed for better spinal alignment</td><td>Softer sleeping surface</td></tr><tr><td>Ideal for</td><td>Firm support and durability</td><td>Those preferring plush comfort</td></tr><tr><td>Focus</td><td>Orthopaedic support and pressure relief</td><td>Coir-based support and affordability</td></tr></tbody></table>]]></prop></mediawithtext><experiencefragment compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/experiencefragment_0\"/><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_2\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[Mattress types offered by Duroflex and Kurlon]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Duroflex and Kurlon offer a wide variety of mattress types designed to suit different comfort preferences, support requirements and budget ranges.</p><br><table><thead><tr><th>Mattress type</th><th>Duroflex</th><th>Kurlon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Memory foam mattresses</td><td>Extensive range with pressure-relieving and body-contouring designs</td><td>Available in selected models with comfort-focused features</td></tr><tr><td>Orthopaedic mattresses</td><td>Wide range designed for back support and spinal alignment</td><td>Offers multiple orthopaedic options across different price segments</td></tr><tr><td>Foam mattresses</td><td>Available in various comfort levels and thickness options</td><td>Offers standard and premium foam mattress models</td></tr><tr><td>Coir mattresses</td><td>Limited selection compared to other categories</td><td>Strong presence with multiple coir-based mattress options</td></tr><tr><td>Spring mattresses</td><td>Available in pocket spring and advanced spring variants</td><td>Offers Bonnell spring and pocket spring mattress models</td></tr><tr><td>Hybrid mattresses</td><td>Combines foam, memory foam and spring technologies</td><td>Available in selected premium mattress collections</td></tr><tr><td>Latex mattresses</td><td>Available in selected premium product ranges</td><td>Limited availability depending on the product line</td></tr><tr><td>Premium luxury mattresses</td><td>Focuses on advanced comfort technologies and premium materials</td><td>Offers premium collections with enhanced support and comfort</td></tr><tr><td>Budget mattresses</td><td>Available across multiple price categories</td><td>Strong range of affordable and entry-level mattress options</td></tr><tr><td>Custom comfort options</td><td>Offers mattresses catering to different sleeping preferences and support needs</td><td>Provides mattresses for varied comfort and firmness requirements</td></tr></tbody></table>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_3\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[Duroflex vs Kurlon - Price comparison]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Duroflex and Kurlon offer mattresses across multiple price segments, from budget-friendly models to premium sleep solutions catering to diverse customer needs.</p><br><table><thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Duroflex mattress model</th><th>Approximate price*</th><th>Kurlon mattress model</th><th>Approximate price*</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Budget orthopaedic mattress</td><td>Duroflex LiveIn Orthopedic Memory Foam</td><td>Rs. 7,500 – Rs. 8,500</td><td>Kurlon Teensy Ortho Foam Mattress</td><td>Rs. 5,500 – Rs. 6,500</td></tr><tr><td>Memory foam mattress</td><td>Duroflex LiveIn Pressure Relieving Memory Foam</td><td>Rs. 8,000 – Rs. 12,500</td><td>Kurlon New Ortho</td><td>Rs. 12,000 – Rs. 18,000</td></tr><tr><td>Firm orthopaedic mattress</td><td>Duroflex Back Magic</td><td>Rs. 15,000 – Rs. 22,000</td><td>Kurlon Convenio</td><td>Rs. 15,000 – Rs. 22,000</td></tr><tr><td>Mid-range mattress</td><td>Duroflex Energise Plus</td><td>Rs. 12,000 – Rs. 18,000</td><td>Kurlon Klassic</td><td>Rs. 10,000 – Rs. 15,000</td></tr><tr><td>Premium orthopaedic mattress</td><td>Duroflex Posture Perfect</td><td>Rs. 20,000 – Rs. 28,000</td><td>Kurlon DuoRest</td><td>Around Rs. 20,000 – Rs. 25,000</td></tr><tr><td>Premium comfort mattress</td><td>Duroflex Balance Plus</td><td>Around Rs. 40,000 and above</td><td>Kurlon Ortho Magic Essential</td><td>Typically premium segment pricing</td></tr></tbody></table><br><p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Each model's features, availability, and pricing are subject to change and may vary. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, please visit the official website.</p><br><p><strong>Note:</strong> Although you can only use Bajaj Finance’s financing options to split any purchase above Rs. 5,000 into Easy EMIs, you can always club your product with other electronics and home appliances to meet the minimum amount and enjoy the same benefits.</p><br><p>Before you decide, explore the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/offers-deals?sso-module=adp&amp;dynamic-redirection=false\">latest offers</a>. You may find a great deal on a model that matches your needs.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><experiencefragment compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/experiencefragment_1\"/><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_4\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[ Get electronics and appliances on Easy EMIs with Bajaj Finance]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Upgrading your home with the latest electronics and app