ose with memory foam, may retain some heat but include ventilation features to enhance breathability and provide a comfortable sleep environment.</p>]]></prop></item><item name=\"item3\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[Which mattress is better for side sleepers – Duroflex or Kurlon?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[<p>For side sleepers, Kurlon mattresses are generally a better choice as they offer plush cushioning and adapt well to the body's curves, reducing pressure on the shoulders and hips. Duroflex mattresses, with their firmer support, are better suited for back and stomach sleepers, ensuring proper spinal alignment.</p>]]></prop></item></accordionList></item></multifield></faqwithtabs><articlesandinsights compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/articlesandinsights\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[More articles]]></prop><multifield name=\"cardsList\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"primaryCtaText\"><![CDATA[Read More]]></prop></item><item name=\"item1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"primaryCtaText\"><![CDATA[Read More]]></prop></item><item name=\"item2\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"primaryCtaText\"><![CDATA[Read More]]></prop></item></multifield></articlesandinsights><breadcrumb compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/breadcrumb\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[Home > Duroflex vs Kurlon Mattresses]]></prop></breadcrumb><overviewtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/overviewtext\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[<p><strong>Mattresses By Brand</strong></p><br><table><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/duroflex\">Duroflex Mattress</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/sleep-spa\">sleepspa Mattress</a></td><td><a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/peps\">Peps Mattress</a></td><td><a h