ttress Is Good For Health]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[Learn how to choose a mattress that supports your health, providing comfort and proper spinal alignment.]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"keyword\"><![CDATA[which mattress is best for health , which mattress is good for sleeping , which mattress is good for health]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"title\"><![CDATA[Choosing a Mattress That is Best for Your Health]]></prop></bb-spdp-page><secondarynavigation compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/secondarynavigation\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"ctaText\"><![CDATA[VIEW OFFERS]]></prop><multifield name=\"tabsList\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitleText\"><![CDATA[6-inch mattresses]]></prop></item><item name=\"item1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitleText\"><![CDATA[Floor mattresses]]></prop></item><item name=\"item2\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitleText\"><![CDATA[How to clean a mattress]]></prop></item><item name=\"item3\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitleText\"><![CDATA[Emma mattresses]]></prop></item></multifield></secondarynavigation><spdpbanner compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/spdpbanner\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"bannerDescription\"><![CDATA[Find the best mattress for your health by comparing support, comfort, firmness, and materials for better sleep and spinal care. Bring home your preferred option on Easy EMIs with Bajaj Finance.]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"bannerTitle\"><![CDATA[How to Choose the Best Mattress for Your Health]]></prop></spdpbanner><navigationcardslist compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/navigationcardslist\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"playlistID\"><![CDATA[v7ROQq]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"channelID\"><![CDATA[My7VlOl]]></prop><multifield name=\"cardsList\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"altText\"><![CDATA[ Bajaj Live]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"title\"><![CDATA[  ]]></prop></item><item name=\"item1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"altText\"><![CDATA[FAQ]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"title\"><![CDATA[FAQs]]></prop></item><item name=\"item2\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"title\"><![CDATA[Smart Savings Calculator]]></prop></item></multifield></navigationcardslist><checkeligibility compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/checkeligibility\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"eligibilityBtnText\"><![CDATA[CHECK ELIGIBILITY]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"loanRange\"><![CDATA[Get a pre-approved loan offer of up to %$$Easy-EMI-Loan-amount$$%]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"redirectUrl\"><![CDATA[https://www.bajajfinserv.in/easy-emi-consumer-durables-loan?sso-module=adp&dynamic-redirection=false]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"termsText\"><![CDATA[Quick approval | Flexible tenure options | Zero approval fees]]></prop></checkeligibility><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[In summary]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p><i>No single mattress is universally the healthiest — the right choice depends on your sleep position, body weight, and specific health concerns. A mattress that keeps your spine in its natural alignment and reduces pressure on your hips, shoulders, and lower back is the healthiest mattress for you.</i></p><ul><li><i><strong>Sleep position is the first decision:</strong> Back sleepers need medium-firm; side sleepers need medium to medium-soft for hip and shoulder pressure relief; stomach sleepers need firm</i></li><li><i><strong>Body weight matters:</strong> Above 80 kg → firmer mattress prevents excessive sinking; below 60 kg → softer mattress allows adequate contouring</i></li><li><i><strong>For back pain:</strong> Orthopaedic mattresses (firm, uniform support) or medium-firm memory foam (contours to lumbar curve without sinking) are most commonly recommended</i></li><li><i><strong>For hip and shoulder pain:</strong> Memory foam or latex — both contour to pressure points and relieve concentrated load at contact areas</i></li><li><i><strong>For hot Indian summers:</strong> Coir or coir-foam hybrid — natural coir fibre allows airflow; memory foam retains heat</i></li><li><p><i><strong>For allergies:</strong> Latex (naturally hypoallergenic and antimicrobial) or coir (natural fibre, hostile to dust mites)</i></p><br></li></ul><p><i>Convert the cost of your new mattress into Easy EMIs using Bajaj Finance's financing options at over %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner stores such as Reliance Digital, Croma, Vijay Sales, and more. </i><a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/easy-emi-consumer-durables-loan?sso-module=adp&amp;dynamic-redirection=false\"><i>Check your eligibility</i></a><i> in 2 minutes.</i></p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[What makes a mattress healthy?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>A healthy <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses/double-bed-mattress?utm_source=bfl_website&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=bonnell_spring_vs_pocket_spring_mattress\">mattress</a> provides the right balance of support and comfort to keep your spine properly aligned and reduce pressure on your body during sleep. It helps distribute body weight evenly, minimises aches and stiffness, and promotes better sleep quality. The ideal mattress depends on your sleeping position, body weight, and personal comfort preferences. Features such as breathable materials, motion isolation, hypoallergenic fabrics, and durable construction can also contribute to a healthier and more comfortable sleeping environment over the long term.</p><br><p>To explore the different <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses\">types of mattresses</a>, visit any of Bajaj Finance's %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner stores — like Vijay Sales, Croma, Reliance Digital, and more — across %$$EMI-locheft$$% cities, including Tier 2 cities like Jaipur, Lucknow, Kochi, Bhopal, and more in India. Choose your preferred model, then use the Bajaj Finance Insta EMI Card or Bajaj Finance Easy EMI Loan to finance it. Convert the cost into Easy EMIs that suit your monthly budget and enjoy zero down payment on select models — take it home without any upfront payment. <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/easy-emi-consumer-durables-loan#adp\">Check your loan eligibility</a> online in minutes so you know exactly what you can get before you step into the store.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_2\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[What are the key features to look out for in mattresses?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Choosing the right mattress depends on support, comfort, durability, and your sleeping habits. Consider these key features before selecting a mattress for long-term comfort and healthy sleep:</p><br><ul><li><strong>Spinal support and firmness:</strong> Choose a firmness level that keeps your spine aligned while providing adequate support for your sleeping position and body weight.</li><li><strong>Pressure relief:</strong> Memory foam, latex, and hybrid mattresses help distribute body weight evenly, reducing pressure on the shoulders, hips, and lower back.</li><li><strong>Breathability and cooling:</strong> Look for breathable fabrics, airflow channels, or cooling gel layers that help regulate temperature and reduce heat build-up during sleep.</li><li><strong>Mattress material:</strong> Foam, spring, latex, and hybrid mattresses each offer different levels of comfort, durability, responsiveness, and motion isolation.</li><li><strong>Motion isolation:</strong> If you share your bed, choose a mattress that minimises movement transfer to reduce disturbances when your partner moves.</li><li><strong>Durability and warranty:</strong> Select a mattress made from high-quality materials with a long warranty to ensure lasting performance and value for money.</li><li><strong>Hypoallergenic properties:</strong> Antimicrobial and dust mite-resistant materials help create a cleaner sleeping environment, especially for allergy-sensitive users.</li></ul><br><p>See the <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/orthopedic-mattress\">orthopaedic mattress guide</a> for model comparisons and explore <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/explore-mattresses-under-10000\">mattresses under Rs. 10,000</a> for curated health-focused options at accessible prices.</p><br><p>See the <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bonnell-spring-vs-pocket-spring-mattress\">Bonnell spring vs pocket spring mattress guide</a> for a detailed comparison.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_3\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[What are the different types of mattresses?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Mattresses are available in different materials and constructions, each offering unique levels of support, comfort, and durability. The most common types include:</p><br><ul><li><strong>Memory foam mattress:</strong> Contours to your body, relieves pressure points, reduces motion transfer, and is well suited for side sleepers and couples seeking enhanced comfort.</li><li><strong>Spring mattress:</strong> Uses interconnected or pocket springs to provide responsive support, better airflow, and a traditional bouncy feel suitable for a wide range of sleepers.</li><li><strong>Latex mattress:</strong> Made from natural or synthetic latex, offering excellent durability, responsive support, natural breathability, and resistance to dust mites and allergens.</li><li><strong>Hybrid mattress:</strong> Combines memory foam or latex with pocket springs to deliver balanced comfort, pressure relief, airflow, and strong edge support.</li><li><strong>Orthopaedic mattress:</strong> Designed to provide firmer support, promote proper spinal alignment, and reduce back or joint discomfort for those needing additional support.</li><li><strong>Coir mattress:</strong> Made from natural coconut coir fibres, offering a firm sleeping surface, good ventilation, and durability, making it suitable for warmer climates.</li><li><strong>Air mattress:</strong> Allows users to adjust firmness by changing the air pressure, making it suitable for temporary use, guests, or customised comfort preferences.</li></ul><br><p>For a deeper comparison, see the <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/coir-mattress-vs-foam-mattress\">coir vs foam mattress guide</a>.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><experiencefragment compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/experiencefragment_0\"/><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_4\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[What are the benefits of using a good mattress?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>A good mattress supports healthy sleep by improving comfort, spinal alignment, and pressure relief. Its key benefits extend beyond sleep quality to overall well-being and long-term health.</p><br><ul><li><strong>Promotes proper spinal alignment:</strong> Provides balanced support that helps maintain the natural curve of the spine, reducing strain on the back, neck, and shoulders during sleep.</li><li><strong>Improves sleep quality:</strong> Minimises discomfort and unnecessary movement, helping you fall asleep faster, stay asleep longer, and wake up feeling more refreshed.</li><li><strong>Relieves pressure points:</strong> Evenly distributes body weight to reduce pressure on the hips, shoulders, knees, and lower back, improving overall sleeping comfort.</li><li><strong>Reduces motion transfer:</strong> Mattresses with memory foam or hybrid construction absorb movement, making them ideal for couples who share a bed.</li><li><strong>Supports better posture:</strong> Consistent body support throughout the night helps prevent poor sleeping posture that can contribute to muscle stiffness and joint pain.</li><li><strong>Enhances durability and comfort:</strong> High-quality materials retain their shape and support for longer, providing consistent comfort and better long-term value.</li><li><strong>Creates a healthier sleep environment:</strong> Breathable, hypoallergenic, and dust mite-resistant materials improve airflow and help maintain a cleaner, more hygienic sleeping surface.</li></ul>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_5\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[Price list of popular mattresses in India (%$$ESOP-Year-$$%)]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Popular mattresses in India are available across memory foam, latex, hybrid, and orthopaedic categories. The table below compares some well-known models and their approximate prices:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Mattress</strong></td><td><strong>Approximate price</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Wakefit Dual Comfort Mattress</td><td>Rs. 6,874</td></tr><tr><td>Sleepyhead Original Memory Foam Mattress</td><td>Rs. 7,689</td></tr><tr><td>Centuary Sleepables Dual Comfort Mattress</td><td>Rs. 7,640</td></tr><tr><td>Wakefit 7-Zone Latex Mattress</td><td>Rs. 8,699</td></tr><tr><td>Emma Hybrid Memory Foam + Spring Mattress</td><td>Rs. 13,299</td></tr><tr><td>Durfi Orthopedic Mattress</td><td>Rs. 13,739</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday Hybrid Mattress</td><td>Rs. 15,999</td></tr><tr><td>Sunday Ortho Latex Mattress</td><td>Rs. 21,999</td></tr></tbody></table><br><p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> Each model's features, availability, and pricing are subject to change and may vary. For the most accurate and up-to-date information, please visit the official website.</p><br><p>Before you decide, explore the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/offers-deals?sso-module=adp&amp;dynamic-redirection=false\">latest offers</a>. You may find a great deal on a model that matches your needs.</p><br>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_6\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[What are my financing options to buy a mattress?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Bajaj Finance offers two ways to convert your mattress purchase into affordable monthly payments. Both options are available at over %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner stores across %$$EMI-locheft$$% cities in India. Here is a comparison of both options to help you choose before visiting a partner store:</p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Option</strong></td><td><strong>Limit</strong></td><td><strong>Key features</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Bajaj Finance Insta EMI Card</td><td>Pre-approved card limit up to %$$EMI-limit$$%</td><td>Zero annual fee; %$$Repayment-Tenure$$%; works at %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner outlets; %$$EMI-productheft$$% eligible products</td></tr><tr><td>Bajaj Finance Easy EMI Loan</td><td>Loan limit up to %$$Easy-EMI-Loan-amount$$%</td><td>Quick loan approval; %$$Repayment-Tenure$$%; basic KYC documents needed; ideal for higher-value purchases</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>How to choose?</strong> Both options require you to be physically present at a partner store. The Insta EMI Card is ideal for shoppers who want to purchase across multiple categories over time — and carries zero annual fee. The Easy EMI Loan suits buyers looking to finance a premium memory foam or hybrid mattress in a single transaction.</p><p>With over %$$EMI-storeheft$$% partner stores across %$$EMI-locheft$$% cities, Bajaj Finance's network means you can finance your mattress purchase whether you are in a metro or a Tier 2 city like Jaipur or Coimbatore.</p>]]></prop></mediawithtext><mediawithtext compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/mediawithtext_7\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"headingText\"><![CDATA[How do I buy a health-appropriate mattress on EMI at a Bajaj Finance partner store?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"descText\"><![CDATA[<p>Upgrading to a new mattress is simple and affordable with Bajaj Finance's in-store financing options. The entire process usually takes just 10–15 minutes. Follow these steps:</p><br><ol><li><strong>Identify your sleep position and main health concern:</strong> Use the sleep position table above to determine the right firmness level. Note any specific conditions — back pain, hip pain, allergies, heat sensitivity.</li><li><strong>Browse on Bajaj Mall:</strong> Explore <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bmall/mattresses\">mattresses </a>on Bajaj Mall. Filter by type (memory foam, orthopaedic, coir, spring) and compare firmness, thickness, and price. Also read the <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/how-to-choose-the-right-mattress\">how to choose the right mattress guide</a> for additional guidance.</li><li><strong>Test in person:</strong> Visit a Bajaj Finance partner store and lie on the mattress in your usual sleep position for at least 5 minutes. Your spine should feel supported — not sinking or strained.</li><li><strong>Find a partner store:</strong> Use the <a href=\"https://www.bajajfinserv.in/bajaj-mall-store-locator\">Bajaj Finance store locator</a> to find a nearby outlet.</li><li><strong>Bundle if below Rs. 5,000:</strong> Pair an entry mattress with a mattress protector or pillow set to reach the Easy EMI minimum.</li><li><strong>Choose a suitable EMI option:</strong> Ask the store executive about the Bajaj Finance Insta EMI Card or Easy EMI Loan