/responsivegrid/bannerizationbannercarouseldynamic\"/><experiencefragment compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/experiencefragment_3\"/><faqwithtabs compPath=\"/jcr:content/root/container/responsivegrid/faqwithtabs\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"showMoreText\"><![CDATA[Show More]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"faqTitle\"><![CDATA[FAQs]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"showLessText\"><![CDATA[Show Less]]></prop><multifield name=\"tabDetails\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitle\"><![CDATA[General]]></prop><accordionList name=\"accordionList\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[Which kind of mattress is good for health?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[<p>A mattress that provides proper support, relieves pressure points, and promotes spinal alignment is ideal for health. Memory foam, latex, and hybrid mattresses are known for offering these benefits, helping to prevent pain and ensure restful sleep for better overall wellbeing.</p>]]></prop></item><item name=\"item1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[Does a good mattress improve health?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[<p>Yes, a good mattress significantly improves health by promoting better sleep quality, reducing body aches, and supporting spinal alignment. By providing adequate pressure relief and comfort, it helps prevent long term health issues such as back pain, joint discomfort, and poor posture.</p>]]></prop></item></accordionList></item><item name=\"item1\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"tabTitle\"><![CDATA[EMI details]]></prop><accordionList name=\"accordionList\"><item name=\"item0\"><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"heading\"><![CDATA[Can I buy a mattress on EMI?]]></prop><prop isMultiVal=\"false\" name=\"description\"><![CDATA[<p>Yes, you can easily bring home your preferred mattress using Bajaj Finance’s Easy E